From 8b8a57f34ae5daa93cb6f32cc4bb214153456e99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 10:39:07 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 11/38] Implement sample-scoped DWARF indexing

Implement sample-scoped ELF and DWARF loading, line and inline indexes,
symbol identity lookup, and address symbolization.  Only compilation units
touched by profile samples are parsed, limiting memory and load time on
large binaries.

afdo_tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/dwarf_reader.cc: New file.
	* src/dwarf_reader_impl.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
