From ad418a65d874321d5b501c0505c618e443b33901 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 10:39:09 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 13/38] Define the profile reader interface

Add the abstract profile_reader interface that the perf, branch-stack
and SPE readers derive from.  It precedes them because a base class
cannot be forward declared, so each reader header needs this
definition to parse.

afdo_tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/profile_reader.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
 afdo_tools/src/profile_reader.h | 126 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 126 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 afdo_tools/src/profile_reader.h

diff --git a/afdo_tools/src/profile_reader.h b/afdo_tools/src/profile_reader.h
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..9521e6efcee
--- /dev/null
+++ b/afdo_tools/src/profile_reader.h
@@ -0,0 +1,126 @@
+/* Copyright The GNU Toolchain Authors
+
+This file is part of GCC.
