From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 10:39:12 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 16/38] Add common branch-stack ingestion

Add the common machinery for translating branch-stack samples and runtime
mappings into file-relative ranges and edges.  Backend-specific readers
build on this normalization layer.

afdo_tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/branch_stack_reader_base.cc: New file.
	* src/branch_stack_reader_base.h: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
