From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 10:39:21 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 25/38] Deposit source and call-edge profile mass

Deposit selected function mass onto source locations and inline callsite
trees.  The implementation coalesces equivalent ranges and records direct
and indirect call edges without double counting source positions.

afdo_tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/autofdo_correlate_deposit.cc: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
