From 6ba9b01254f4c65b3c012eab945b2b513b1e9f0c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 10:39:23 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 27/38] Add the profile correlation driver

Add the public driver that sequences bucketing, target materialization, work
estimation, and parallel source correlation.  This provides one
orchestration boundary between perf ingestion and GCOV export.

afdo_tools/ChangeLog:

