From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 10:39:26 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 30/38] Add the afdo_create command

Add the afdo_create command-line frontend for producing GCOV AutoFDO
profiles from an executable and its samples.  It validates options, selects
between offline perf.data, live capture and ARM SPE sources, and drives the
profiler pipeline introduced by the preceding patches.  create_gcov option
spellings are accepted so existing AutoFDO scripts keep working.

afdo_tools/ChangeLog:

	* src/afdo_create.cc: New file.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
 afdo_tools/src/afdo_create.cc | 471 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 471 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 afdo_tools/src/afdo_create.cc

diff --git a/afdo_tools/src/afdo_create.cc b/afdo_tools/src/afdo_create.cc
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..139531edb1c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/afdo_tools/src/afdo_create.cc
@@ -0,0 +1,471 @@
