From c51bc6e857ee3213c9797c46261b3d52595df4bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 10:39:28 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 32/38] Wire afdo_tools into the GCC build

Register afdo_tools as an optional bootstrapped GCC host module and
regenerate the top-level build files.  The module is configured on
GNU/Linux hosts only, is skipped when testing a cross compiler, and is
ordered after the host dependencies it needs.  Its sources are added to the
list scanned for translatable strings.

ChangeLog:

	* Makefile.def (host_modules): Add afdo_tools as a bootstrapped
	host module and skip its checks for cross builds.
	(dependencies): Order afdo_tools after configure-gcc and gettext.
	* Makefile.in: Regenerate.
	* configure: Likewise.
	* configure.ac: Configure afdo_tools on GNU/Linux hosts only.

gcc/po/ChangeLog:

	* exgettext: Scan ../afdo_tools/src for translatable strings.

Signed-off-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
 Makefile.def     |    7 +
 Makefile.in      | 1306 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 configure        |   26 +
 configure.ac     |   20 +
 gcc/po/exgettext |    4 +-
 5 files changed, 1359 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

