 Makefile.tpl                  | 11 ++++++++---
 gcc/Makefile.in               |  6 +++++-
 gcc/c/Make-lang.in            |  6 +++---
 gcc/cp/Make-lang.in           |  6 +++---
 gcc/lto/Make-lang.in          |  6 +++---
