+GNU/Linux hosts and @samp{configure} disables them elsewhere.  They
+require @code{libelf}, @code{libdw} and @code{zlib}.  They run on the
+host and do not depend on the target that GCC is configured for.
+@option{--disable-afdo_tools} is the default.
